        "english": "The first thought that came to my mind was I had to go to work, no matter what.",
        "vietnamese": "Cái suy nghĩ đầu tiên chạy qua đầu tao là tao phải đi làm, bất kỳ giá nào.",
        "speaker": null,
        "audio_url": null,
        "beat_prosody": "The first thought that came to my mind was I had to go to work // no matter what.",
